@startuml
left to right direction

' Global settings
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

' Use Case styling
skinparam usecase {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #2B3E6A
    FontColor #000000
}

' Actor styling
skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #2B3E6A
    FontColor #000000
}

' Note styling
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FDE2B8
    BorderColor #2B3E6A
    FontColor #000000
}

' Arrow styling
skinparam arrow {
    Color #2B3E6A
}

'=== Actors ===
' Define your actors here (e.g., actor "Customer" as cust)


'=== System Boundary ===
rectangle "System Name" {

    '=== Use Cases ===
    ' Define your use cases here (e.g., usecase "Login" as UC1)

}

'=== Relationships ===
' Connect actors to use cases or use cases to each other here

@enduml